[PrintTextModified Text:自从诺亚不在了以后，<br>我几乎没有再踏足这里。|#0204Adv04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是我在刻意回避。|#0204Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（诺亚的画室……吗。<br>　给这里命名的诺亚本人，已经不在了）|#0204Adv04_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只是不经意走进来，<br>并不是因为典狱长有可能在这里……|#0204Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我本以为<br>寂静的画室里空无一人，<br>没想到汉娜在画室里。|#0204Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜坐在椅子上，<br>专心致志地埋头缝纫。|#0204Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀……你们，<br>来这里有什么事吗？|#0204Adv04_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:察觉我们到来，<br>汉娜表情略显紧张地问道。|#0204Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜是为什么还在这里缝纫呢？<br>舞台服应该全都已经制作完毕了才对……|#0204Adv04_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜嘟起嘴，别过头去。|#0204Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来就喜欢缝纫。<br>现在做的不是舞台服，而是人偶。|#0204Adv04_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多亏雪莉收集了这么多布料，<br>现在还剩了一大堆呢。|#0204Adv04_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:最近艾玛没什么精神，<br>我有点担心她。<br>所以想着，能不能用这个让她开心一点……|#0204Adv04_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看向她手中的作品，<br>那似乎是以我们为原型制作的人偶。|#0204Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她正在制作的是艾玛的人偶。|#0204Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她好努力啊……<br>　这也说明艾玛已经和汉娜<br>　亲密到这种程度了吧）|#0204Adv04_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀！汉娜真是心灵手巧。<br>每天还会为大家洗衣服，<br>我做家务可一点不拿手，真的很羡慕你。|#0204Adv04_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:羡慕……？|#0204Adv04_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅站在画室里摆放的演出用礼服前，<br>眯起眼睛，露出陶醉的表情。|#0204Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『舞台衣装』表示
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:9-13

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜亲手制作的演出礼服……<br>真是精美绝伦。|#0204Adv04_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这金色的刺绣，<br>实在是太美了……让人舍不得移开目光。|#0204Adv04_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然最美丽的还是要数主角的服装！<br>但这顶王冠也精致得不分伯仲。|#0204Adv04_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『王冠』表示
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:9-5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那可不是我做的哦。|#0204Adv04_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，这、这样啊……|#0204Adv04_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那是米莉亚<br>按照安安的要求制作的。|#0204Adv04_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安说，<br>无论如何都想要一顶王冠……|#0204Adv04_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜露出一抹寂寞的神色，低下头。<br>剧本是我和安安一起编写的，所以马上就明白了她的意思。|#0204Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，剧本在大纲的基础上改动了不少，<br>　比起小飞侠本人，王子倒更像是主角了）|#0204Adv04_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然蕾雅很高兴就是了）|#0204Adv04_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（所以才有了这顶王冠吗……）|#0204Adv04_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我听诺亚说，<br>安安其实<br>很想扮演温蒂。|#0204Adv04_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，确实，她的确流露出那样的想法……|#0204Adv04_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此……|#0204Adv04_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:一说到诺亚和安安的话题，<br>气氛顿时沉重起来。|#0204Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，希罗，不要气馁啊。<br>我还没有放弃舞台！|#0204Adv04_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅仿佛要驱散这股沉闷的气息，<br>朗声宣布道。|#0204Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还想穿上<br>汉娜精心制作的主角服装呢。|#0204Adv04_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:主角用的舞台服，就连上面的刺绣也是美不胜收……<br>啊，汉娜真是太了不起了。<br>我发自内心敬佩着你。|#0204Adv04_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆言葉に詰まる

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0204Adv04_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被蕾雅直率的双瞳这样看着，一对上视线，<br>汉娜的脸颊瞬间染上红晕，立刻背过身去。|#0204Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我、我很、很忙的，<br>你们快点离开吧……！|#0204Adv04_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果真的要演舞台剧，<br>服装还需要再做些调整呢……|#0204Adv04_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

