[PrintTextModified Text:我和蕾雅对视一眼。|#0204Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这大概是害羞了吧……<br>　蕾雅说话，用词总是这么夸张）|#0204Adv04_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不能再打扰汉娜了。<br>我们该走了，希罗。|#0204Adv04_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv04_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

